     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Hello,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> I am\r\nworking on cross-lagged model with only manifest variables (i.e. &quot;</span><span lang=\"EN-CA\">modeltest&quot;), 6 times measures\r\nand MCAR NA’s. I am carrying out a cross-lagged model with invariant\r\ncovariables (eg sexe, age, without NA&#39;s) and time variant covariables (eg radio\r\n(0/1), with NA’s). <br></span></p><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">modeltest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<br>smsport.2 ~ smsport.0 + FUMnb.0 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.2<br>smsport.6 ~ smsport.2 + FUMnb.2 +  sexe1 + age  + radio.6     <br>smsport.10 ~ smsport.6 + FUMnb.6 +  sexe1  + age+ radio.10<br>smsport.14 ~ smsport.10 + FUMnb.10 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.14<br>smsport.18 ~ smsport.14 + FUMnb.14 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.18<br><br>FUMnb.2  ~ smsport.0 + FUMnb.0 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.2<br>FUMnb.6  ~ smsport.2 + FUMnb.2 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.6<br>FUMnb.10  ~ smsport.6 + FUMnb.6 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.10<br>FUMnb.14  ~ smsport.10 + FUMnb.10 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.14<br>FUMnb.18  ~ smsport.14 + FUMnb.14 +  sexe1 + age+ radio.18<br><br>smsport.0 ~ sexe1  + revenu2+ age+ smpoids.0 <br>FUMnb.0  ~ sexe1  + revenu2+ age+ smpoids.0<br>&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>fitmodetest </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sem </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">modeltest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">APswide</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> estimator </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MLR&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> information </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;observed&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missing </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;fiml&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fitmodetest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">measures</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> standardized</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rsquare</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><span lang=\"EN-CA\">My model model has good fit indices. I would perform a\r\nmutligroup analysis (depressed or not), but it does not work. I obtain a error message. I do not understand, I think that the problem is the presence of NA&#39;s in time variant covar. <br></span><br><code><span style=\"color:#000\">fitmodetestDEP </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sem </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">modeltest</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">APswide</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> estimator </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MLR&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Depressed&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> information </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;observed&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missing </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;fiml&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> estimate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">moments</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">EM</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">g</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> M </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missing</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">g</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> verbose </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> verbose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br> lavaan ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_22</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inv cannot be inverted</span><span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Saisissez</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> le code ici</span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span></div></code></div></span></code><div><br>Any help is much appreciated, I am basically reasearch postdoc but not statistician.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you all in advance for your time!<br><br>Paquito<br></div><span lang=\"EN-CA\"><br></span><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div></div>"
